cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "RadCheck-Bench-ES"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark for detecting internal inconsistencies in Spanish radiology reports:
  contradictions of laterality, negation and measurement that can be verified from the
  text alone, with 200 clean reports (half of them hard negatives), plus a separate track
  for omissions and dictation typos.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-31"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
